deo  trump did i'm forgetting the exact  timeline but it might have been five  ish eastern time where trump came out  and said  it's time to go home we love you  paraphrasing here you're justified  in your belief about the election being  stolen the impetus for why you showed up  and rioted  the this is my paraphrasing is a good  one it's an  accurate one because it was really  stolen but as much as we love you  it's time to go home even in that you  could tell trump was thrilled and trump  was  was actually supportive of the rioters  and so  that further is corroboration and you  have to read the book to look at the  full the full sourcing of it  um that indeed is is more corroboration  of what we already believed to be true  and then lastly we reported a few weeks  ago that  ivanka trump and jared kushner are  supposedly distancing themselves from  donald trump pretty significantly  and carol lenig's additional insights in  the book along with  philip rucker are that ivanka trump was  asking donald trump as the riots were  unfolding  you've got to stop this do something  about this you've got to do something  about it and trump refused and  again if the reporting that we've seen  is to be believed  that indeed ivanka trump was not pleased  about that  that would also be coherent with what  has already been reported  none of this is shocking it's just none  of this we don't there's nothing that  we're hearing  here where we say whoa that's totally  out of character with trump  that just doesn't make any sense no the  impression we got at the time was that  it was because of trump that authorities  didn't show up more quickly  that's exactly the reporting that has  come out since the our impression at the  time from trump's  weird video was he liked the rioters and  that is now what philip rucker and carol  lennog are  uh asserting in their book i alone can  fix it so none of it is shocking but  there is more detail  in the book um the one other thing i  would say when  sometimes people write to me they say  david like what's the point of this book  now at this point  well books take time to write you know  to expect a book about the trump riots  on january 16th 10 days later it's not  it's not reasonable it takes a while to  write books and when you're when you're  writing a book  and sourcing it and fact checking it in  this type of thing it's going to take  some period of time  there were lots of people who weren't  really paying attention back then to  those reports  and they're now hearing this stuff for  the first time and i do think that  that's relevant as well i know trump  owns the republican party  most republicans just don't care about  this or they won't believe it  but i do think that we're exposing more  people to this  reality for the first time and that is  worth it but  just an incredible incredible revelation  and completely coherent  with what we believed at the time
 

